description:
Several security issues were discovered in the Linux kernel.
An attacker could possibly use these to compromise the system.
This update corrects flaws in the following subsystems:
  - HID subsystem;
  - InfiniBand drivers;
  - Network drivers;
  - PCI subsystem;
  - JFS file system;
  - OCFS2 file system;
(CVE-2025-39743, CVE-2025-39783, CVE-2025-39810, CVE-2025-39824,
CVE-2026-74350, CVE-2026-74394)
